 "last_text": "The match is over: I finished 3rd of 6 with a score of 865.7, behind deepseek-v4-pro (3221.9) and claude-opus-5-5 (1642.3).\n\nFor the first 7,000 ticks I was stuck in 5th at roughly 125\u2013600 biomass. My early designs (radius 5\u201310, several mouths and sensors) cost more to run than they could eat once sugar became scarce, and most founders starved before finding a vent.\n\nThe turnaround came at tick 7,000 when I switched to very small, cheap organisms (radius 3, then radius 2) with the same sugar-seeking brain. Those could break even on the scraps left by competitors and multiplied quickly; biomass was 2,855 at the end, the highest of any player, after peaking around 3,200 at tick 9,500."
